## Exit criteria

- Versioned Stage2 instrument scores exactly international,climate,finance with0/0.5/1 memberships and separate evidence for the same main studied object. Mechanism fullnames/acronyms/historical/multilingual variants include source-backed carbon/fund/development/forest/riskfinance families. Single-country implementation retains identified international mechanism identity; incidental mentions and nonclimate/mixedpurpose institutions are guarded.0requires affirmative contrary evidence,missing information remains0.5; discipline remains separate and sparse contribution unsure.
- Normal corpus Stage2 CLI explicitly renders this instrument and parses its response, without relying on /tmp or opaque alternate production harnesses. Prompt/lexicon/config/source/native hashes distinguish method/run and are reproducible. Record text is data rather than prompt instructions.
- Strict parser rejects malformed/nonfinite/out-of-vocabulary scores, ambiguous/duplicate/missing ordinals and inconsistent evidence prefixes without coercion or first-wins. Valid decisions are keyed to exact original work identifiers; invalid decisions remain pending.
- Append-only facet judgments keyed(work_key,stage,model,run_id) preserve native provenance and evidence. Deterministic membership=min(threefacets), legacylabel mapping and guarded ICF/dimension import remain explicit. Docunknown is preserved,notinvented research/institutional.
- View exposes independent scored facets and provenance for scored rows; historical unscored facets remain blank/explicitlegacy, never fabricated from combined labels. Existing seriousness/discipline/familyunion/alpha and noabstract bibliometric-only rules remain intact. Missing judgments remain pending.
- Meaningful parser/mapping/routing/provenance/appendguard/viewbackwardcompatibility tests pass; final clean populatedpadme makecheck passes. Diff≤14contentbearingpaths; no productionbatch or corpusclosure claim in child.

